---
name: Onboard Palo Alto Networks syslog via UDP
description: |
  Reads Palo Alto Networks syslog over UDP in the RFC 3164 (BSD) or RFC 5424
  (IETF) format, normalizes PAN-OS CSV payloads to OCSF 1.9, and publishes
  them to the topic `ocsf`.
---

accept_udp "0.0.0.0:514"
this = data.parse_syslog()
// The firewall writes its local time without a zone. Set `timezone` only when
// that time isn't UTC and the records lack `high_resolution_timestamp`, whose
// offset the normalizer uses otherwise.
paloalto::ocsf::normalize timezone="Europe/Zurich"
this = ocsf_derive(this)
publish "ocsf"
